  "note": "Functional needs, not medical categories. This is the PRIMARY index: every rule and every fixture names the needs it serves, because one requirement usually serves several forms of access at once. A keyboard-access rule supports non-visual operation, alternative input, switch access and voice-control workflows — indexing by criterion alone hides that.",
